---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Migrate .spec files to the current format: the version header, and a title for every block that has none

Usage: specforge migrate [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --dry-run
          Show unified diff without modifying files

      --no-backup
          Skip creating .spec.bak backup files

      --rollback
          Restore files from .spec.bak backups

      --target-version <TARGET_VERSION>
          Target format version (defaults to current)

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
